+    "file": "app/tasks.py",
+    "line": 18,
+    "why": "Same shell=True sink, but is_sha uses SHA_RE.fullmatch on [0-9a-f]{7,40}, so only hex characters reach the shell; metacharacters, whitespace and trailing newlines are rejected (verified is_sha('abc1234;id') and is_sha('abc1234\\n') are False). No injection or option injection possible."
+  },
+  {
+    "verdict": "rejected",
